        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 935MD, Modern Knob with Matching Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis ultra modern door knobset is made by Omnia, so you know you can expect it to last a lifetime. The Modern Knob with Matching Rose is great for upscale remodels and new homes. The modern look is accentuated by clean lines and beautiful finishing details. The 935 knob with modern rose is available in 8 finishes including satin brass, satin chrome, and polished nickel. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. This knobset is available for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets and comes packaged packaged for both 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>55° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a> </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 935MD Modern Knob with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, privacy button, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ultra Modern Knobset, Omnia 935MD",
                "description": "Omnia 935MD, Ultra Modern Knobset - This Ultra Modern Knobset is made by Omnia, so you know you can expect it to last a lifetime. The Modern Knob with Matching Rose is great for upscale remodels and new homes. The modern look is accentuated by clean lines and beautiful finishing details. The 935 knob with modern rose is available in 8 finishes including satin brass, satin chrome, and polished nickel. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. This knobset is available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and comes packaged packaged for both 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch thick doors.",
                "keywords": "Ultra Modern Knobsets, Omnia 935MD, Modern Knob with Modern Roses, OMN-935MD, omnia prodigy collections, solid brass door knobs, Omnia Standard door knobs, classic knobs, modern knobs, passage knobs, privacy knobs, Contemporary Knobsets, Modern Knob with Matching Roses, Omnia 935MD Modern Knob with Round Roses, Ultra Modern Door Knobs,"
